    # "{cps=200}Wow.{w=0.3} This is quite a prank!{w=0.3} You sure outdid yourself!{w=0.3} How did you set it up?{w=0.3} How did you do this?{w=0.3} How did you know, Garin?{w=0.3} Tell me, how did you know?{w=0.3} How did you know?{w=0.3}{nw}"
